    's1_title' => '1. Ukuvumelana nale migomo.',
    's1_body' => 'Le Migomo Nemibandela ("Imigomo") ilawula ukufinyelela kwakho nokusebenzisa kwakho i-Ledger, kuhlanganise newebhusayithi yethu, ulwazi lweselula, nazo zonke izici ezihlobene ne-akhawunti, inkokhelo, ikhadi nosizo (ndawonye, "Isevisi"). Ngokudala i-akhawunti noma ngokusebenzisa Isevisi, uyavuma ukuboshwa yile Migomo nanoma yiziphi izinqubomgomo ezishiwo kuyo. Uma ungavumi, ungadali i-akhawunti noma usebenzise Isevisi.',
    's2_title' => '2. Ukufaneleka.',
