    's3_title' => '3. I-akhawunti yakho.',
    's3_body' => 'Amabhalansi ama-akhawunti e-Ledger awagcinwa ngqo yi-Ledger njengebhange. Imali igcinwa kuma-akhawunti okugcina ahlanganisiwe ebhange elilodwa noma amaningi angabalingani aqinisekiswe yi-FDIC, futhi imali yakho ifanelekile emshwalensini wamadiphozi we-FDIC "odlulayo" kuze kufike emkhawulweni osebenzayo, ngokuya ngemithetho ye-FDIC, ukuhlanganiswa nanoma iyiphi enye imali onayo ebhange elifanayo elingumlingani, nokwehluleka kwebhange elingumlingani. I-Ledger uqobo iyinkampani yezobuchwepheshe bezezimali, hhayi ibhange elinelayisensi. Ungaba ne-akhawunti eyodwa kuphela yomuntu siqu ngaphandle uma sivumelana ngokubhaliwe, futhi i-akhawunti ayinakusetshenziswa ukwamukela imali egameni lebhizinisi, ithrasti, noma omunye umuntu ngaphandle kwemvume yethu ebhaliwe kusengaphambili.',
    's4_title' => '4. Ukuqinisekisa ubunikazi nemikhawulo ye-akhawunti.',
    's4_body' => 'Umthetho kahulumeni wobumbano udinga ukuthi abahlinzeki bezinsizakalo zezezimali bathole, baqinisekise, futhi barekhode ulwazi oluhlonza umuntu ngamunye ovula i-akhawunti. Singakucela ukuthi uhambise umqulu wokuzazisa onesithombe, i-selfie, noma umqulu wobufakazi bekheli, futhi singakhawulela amanani okudlulisa, ukukhishwa kwamakhadi, noma ezinye izici kuze kube yilapho lolo lwazi selubuyekeziwe futhi lagunyazwa. Singaphinda siqinisekise ulwazi lwakho ngezikhathi ezithile futhi simise izici ezithintekayo uma isicelo solwazi olubuyekeziwe singaphendulwa.',
    's5_title' => '5. Ukudlulisa nezinkokhelo.',
    's5_body' => 'Isevisi isekela izindlela eziningana zokunyakazisa imali, ngayinye ingaphansi kwemikhawulo, izikhathi zokuvala, nokubuyekezwa okuboniswa kuwe ngesikhathi sokuthengiselana: (a) ukudlulisa kwe-Ledger kuya ku-Ledger, okuthunyelwa ngokushesha phakathi kwama-akhawunti e-Ledger; (b) ukudlulisa kwasebhange langaphandle, okuthunyelwa ebhange elixhunyanisiwe noma elikhethiwe ezweni elifanayo kusetshenziswa ulwazi lokuqondisa lwalelo bhange; (c) ukudlulisa kwamazwe ngamazwe, okuthunyelwa ebhange elingaphandle kwezwe lakho kusetshenziswa ikhodi ye-SWIFT/BIC yalelo bhange nenombolo ye-akhawunti noma ye-IBAN, okungathatha isikhathi eside ukufika, kungadlula emabhange angabaxhumanisi angaphandle kokulawula kwethu, futhi kungaba ngaphansi kokushintshwa kwemali ngezinga elinqunywa ngesikhathi ukudlulisa kucutshungulwa; (d) ukukhokha izikweletu, okuthunyelwa kumamukeli omqokayo; kanye (e) nokukhipha nokufaka imali, okunyakazisa imali phakathi kwebhalansi yakho ye-Ledger nekhadi elixhunyanisiwe noma i-akhawunti yangaphandle. Unesibopho sokufaka imininingwane ephelele neqondile yomamukeli, yokuqondisa, ye-SWIFT/BIC neye-akhawunti — i-Ledger ayikwazi ukuhlehlisa ukudlulisa okuthunyelwe ngendlela efanele emininingwaneni oyinikezile, noma ngabe leyo mininingwane ibingalungile. Ukudlulisa kungabambezeleka, kubanjwe ukuze kubuyekezwe, noma kwenqatshwe uma kumakwe ngenxa yokusolwa kokukhwabanisa, ukuhlolwa kwezijeziso, noma ibhalansi etholakalayo enganele.',
    's6_title' => '6. Ukudlulisa okuhleliwe.',
    's6_body' => 'Ukudlulisa okuhlelela usuku lwesikhathi esizayo kuhanjiswa kuphela ngosuku olukhethiwe futhi akuqinisekisiwe kuze kube yilapho kushiye ngempela ibhalansi yakho. Ungakhansela ukudlulisa okuhleliwe noma nini ngaphambi kwalolo suku kusukela emlandweni we-akhawunti yakho. Uma ibhalansi yakho etholakalayo inganele ngosuku oluhleliwe, ukudlulisa kuzokwehluleka futhi kuzomakwa ngokufanele emlandweni wakho; kuwumthwalo wakho ukuqinisekisa ukuthi imali eyanele iyatholakala.',
    's7_title' => '7. Izimali ezikhokhwayo.',
    's7_body' => 'I-Ledger okwamanje ayikhokhisi lutho ngokudlulisa kwe-Ledger kuya ku-Ledger, ukudlulisa kwasebhange langaphandle, ukudlulisa kwamazwe ngamazwe, ukukhipha, noma ukufaka imali okuqalwa ngeSevisi. Ibhange lakho elixhunyanisiwe, okhipha ikhadi, noma ibhange lamazwe ngamazwe elamukelayo lisengakhokhisa izimali zalo — kuhlanganise nezimali zokushintsha imali, zokudlulisa noma zebhange elingumxhumanisi ekudluliseni kwamazwe ngamazwe — ezingaphandle kokulawula kwethu futhi ezingakhokhiswa noma zigcinwe yi-Ledger. Uma i-Ledger yethula imali ekhokhwayo yanoma yisiphi isici esikhathini esizayo, leyo mali izodalulwa kuwe ngaphambi kokuthi uqinisekise ukuthengiselana, futhi le Migomo izobuyekezwa ukuyichaza.',
    's8_title' => '8. Amakhadi.',
    's8_body' => 'Uma ucela ikhadi le-debit elingokoqobo noma elibonakalayo elixhunyaniswe nebhalansi yakho ye-Ledger, lelo khadi lingaphansi kokugunyazwa futhi, uma selikhishiwe, lidonsa ngqo ebhalansini yakho etholakalayo ngesikhathi sokuthenga ngakunye — akusona isikweletu. Kufanele ubike ngokushesha ikhadi elilahlekile, elebiwe, noma elisengozini usebenzisa ikhasi lamakhadi ukuze limiswe noma livalwe; uhlala unesibopho sokuthengiselana okwenziwe ngaphambi kokuthi umbiko wamukelwe, ngaphandle kwalapho kukhawulelwe khona ngumthetho osebenzayo nesigaba 10 ngezansi.',
    's9_title' => '9. Imithwalo yakho nokuphepha kwe-akhawunti.',
    's9_body' => 'Unesibopho sokugcina iphasiwedi yakho, i-PIN yokuthengiselana, amakhodi okuqinisekisa ngezinyathelo ezimbili, nedivayisi oyisebenzisayo ukufinyelela ku-Ledger kuphephile, nokungabelani nazo nanoma ubani. Kufanele usazise ngokushesha ngekhasi losizo uma ukholelwa ukuthi i-akhawunti yakho, iphasiwedi noma ikhadi kusengozini, noma uma ubona ukuthengiselana ongakwazi. Uyavuma ukugcina ulwazi lwakho lokuxhumana, ikheli leposi, nemiqulu yobunikazi esinayo kusesikhathini futhi kunembile.',
    's10_title' => '10. Amaphutha nokuthengiselana okungagunyaziwe.',
    's10_body' => 'Uma ukholelwa ukuthi ukudlulisa, ukukhokhiswa kwekhadi, noma okunye ukuthengiselana kwenziwe ngaphandle kwemvume yakho, noma isitatimende se-akhawunti yakho sinephutha, xhumana nosizo ngokushesha okukhulu futhi kungadluli izinsuku ezingu-60 ngemuva kokuthi umsebenzi uvele okokuqala emlandweni wakho. Sizophenya ngokwethembeka futhi singabuyisela imali okwesikhashana ngesikhathi uphenyo lusaqhubeka. Isibopho sakho sokuthengiselana okungagunyaziwe okuqinisekisiwe sikhawulelwe ngokwezinga elidingwa ngumthetho osebenzayo, inqobo nje uma usazise ngokushesha futhi ungenzanga ngokukhwabanisa noma ngobudedengu obukhulu ekuvikeleni imininingwane yakho yokungena.',
    's11_title' => '11. Ukusetshenziswa okwenqatshelwe.',
    's11_body' => 'Uyavuma ukungasebenzisi Isevisi nganoma iyiphi inhloso engekho emthethweni, kuhlanganise ukushushumbisa imali, ukuxhasa ubuphekula, ukukhwabanisa, noma ukugwema izijeziso; ukungathumeli noma wamukele imali ongenalo ilungelo layo ngokomthetho; ukungazami ukuthola ukufinyelela okungagunyaziwe ku-akhawunti yomunye umsebenzisi noma ezinhlelweni ze-Ledger; noma ukuphazamisa ukusebenza okujwayelekile kweSevisi. Singenqaba, sibambezele, sihlehlise lapho kungenzeka, noma sibike noma yikuphi ukuthengiselana okukholelwa ngokunengqondo ukuthi kwephula lesi sigaba, futhi singabelana ngolwazi nabezomthetho noma abalawuli njengoba kudingwa ngumthetho.',
    's12_title' => '12. Isimo se-akhawunti, ukumiswa nokuvalwa.',
    's12_body' => 'Singamisa, sikhawulele, simise okwesikhashana, noma sivale i-akhawunti yakho, noma senqabe ukuthengiselana okuthile, ngokubona kwethu — kuhlanganise ukuze sihambisane nomthetho, siphenye ukusolwa kokukhwabanisa noma ukusetshenziswa kabi, siphendule isicelo somthetho noma sokulawula, noma lapho sikholelwa ngokunengqondo ukuthi kuyadingeka ukukuvikela wena, omunye umsebenzisi, noma i-Ledger. Lapho kungenzeka, sizokutshela isizathu nokuthi ungasifinyelela kanjani ngekhasi losizo. Ungavala i-akhawunti yakho noma nini ngokuxhumana nosizo, inqobo nje uma ibhalansi yakho inguziro noma ikhishiwe futhi kungekho uphenyo oluvulekile noma ukuthengiselana okusalindile.',
    's13_title' => '13. Ukutholakala kweSevisi; ukuzihlukanisa.',
    's13_body' => 'Sisebenza ukugcina Isevisi itholakala futhi inembile, kodwa Isevisi inikezwa "njengoba injalo" futhi asiqinisekisi ukuthi izohlala ingaphazamiseki, ingenamaphutha, noma itholakala ngaso sonke isikhathi. Asinasibopho sokubambezeleka noma ukwehluleka okubangelwa yizimo ezingaphandle kokulawula kwethu okunengqondo, kuhlanganise ukuphazamiseka ebhange elingumlingani, kunethiwekhi yamakhadi, noma esikhungweni esingumxhumanisi, noma izehlakalo ezingaphezu kwamandla. Ngokwezinga eliphelele elivunyelwe ngumthetho, isibopho esiphelele se-Ledger sanoma isiphi isimangalo esivela ekusebenziseni kwakho Isevisi sikhawulelwe enanini lokuthengiselana okubangele isimangalo, ngaphandle kwalapho ikhambi elibanzi lidingwa ngumthetho ovikela ama-akhawunti ezezimali abathengi.',
    's14_title' => '14. Ukuxazulula izingxabano.',
    's14_body' => 'Uma kuvela ukungaboni ngaso linye phakathi kwakho ne-Ledger, sicela ukuthi uqale uxhumane nosizo ukuze sizame ukukuxazulula ngqo — izinkinga eziningi zingasingathwa ngale ndlela. Uma ingxabano ingakwazi ukuxazululwa ngokungahlelekile, noma iliphi iqembu lingalandela noma yiliphi ikhambi elitholakalayo ngaphansi komthetho osebenzayo. Akukho kule Migomo okukhawulela noma yiliphi ilungelo onalo ngaphansi komthetho wokuvikela abathengi lokuphakamisa ingxabano kumlawuli wesifundazwe noma kahulumeni wobumbano.',
    's15_title' => '15. Ubumfihlo.',
    's15_body' => 'Ukuphatha kwethu ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu nolwezimali — esikuqoqayo, indlela esikusebenzisa ngayo, esingabelana nabo (njengamabhange angabalingani, abahlinzeki bokuqinisekisa ubunikazi, namanethiwekhi amakhadi adingekayo ukusebenzisa Isevisi), nezinketho ezitholakalayo kuwe — kuchazwe emikhubeni yethu yobumfihlo. Sisebenzisa ulwazi lwakho lobunikazi nolwe-akhawunti kuphela ukuze sisebenzise, sivikele, futhi sihambisane nomthetho osebenza kuSevisi, futhi asiwuthengisi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.',
    's16_title' => '16. Izinguquko kule migomo.',
    's16_body' => 'Singabuyekeza le Migomo ngezikhathi ezithile ukuze ibonise izinguquko kuSevisi, kumabhange ethu angabalingani, noma emthethweni osebenzayo. Uma senza ushintsho olubalulekile, sizobuyekeza usuku oluthi "Kubuyekezwe okokugcina" ngenhla futhi, lapho kudingwa ngumthetho, sinikeze isaziso esengeziwe. Ukuqhubeka nokusebenzisa Isevisi ngemuva kokuthi ushintsho luqale ukusebenza kusho ukuthi wamukela Imigomo ebuyekeziwe; uma ungavumelani noshintsho, kufanele uyeke ukusebenzisa Isevisi futhi uvale i-akhawunti yakho.',
    's17_title' => '17. Umthetho olawulayo.',
    's17_body' => 'Le Migomo ilawulwa yimithetho yase-United States nesifundazwe lapho kukhona khona indlunkulu yokusebenza kwe-Ledger, ngaphandle kokunaka imigomo yokushayisana kwemithetho, ngaphandle kwalapho omunye umthetho kudingeka usebenze ngokwendawo yokulawula ohlala kuyo.',
